WEBVTT

00:32:26.040 --> 00:32:30.246
You just sort of get in there
and get everything done.

00:32:30.270 --> 00:32:33.036
AG: It's completely changed
her work process.

00:32:33.060 --> 00:32:36.326
Now, each morning,
she spends 15 minutes planning her day.

00:32:36.350 --> 00:32:40.116
She color-codes emails
and writes lists of priorities.

00:32:40.140 --> 00:32:42.416
All this helps her
complete one task at a time

00:32:42.440 --> 00:32:43.796
and move on to the next one,

00:32:43.820 --> 00:32:46.726
instead of trying
to do three things at once.

00:32:46.750 --> 00:32:50.297
Her productivity and her focus
have improved.

00:32:50.321 --> 00:32:52.436
JW: Going back to five,

00:32:52.460 --> 00:32:57.078
I don't know what I would do
with an extra day at work now.

00:32:57.551 --> 00:32:58.712
AG: Grocery orders.

00:32:58.736 --> 00:33:03.126
JW: (Laughs) Yeah, exactly,
shopping, long breaks.